\itemize{
\item skeleton - Karger's (1999) Skeleton backbone
\item gspar - Satuluri et al's (2011) Global Sparsification backbone
\item lspar - Satuluri et al's (2011) Local Sparsification backbone
\item simmelian - Nick et al's (2013) Simmelian backbone
\item jaccard - Goldberg and Roth's (2003) Jaccard backbone
